.superpowers/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# built projects (each has its own git repo) and runtime state are not part of the infra repo
projects/*
!projects/.gitkeep
state/*
!state/.gitkeep
# business content — kept local (daemon needs backlog/) but stripped from the public repo + history
docs/hustle/
staging-backlog/
backlog/*.md
docs/superpowers/specs/
.tokensave/
# local session handoff — not for the public repo
HANDOFF.md
# the autodoc target list (and the systemd drop-in generated from it) name the operator's
# own repos — local content, like the briefs above. config/autodoc-targets.example.toml is
# the committed template.
config/autodoc-targets.toml
deploy/autodoc-targets.conf
config/improve-targets.toml
deploy/improve-targets.conf
# plugin telemetry written into the session cwd by a Claude Code hook — never ours
observability/
